100
00:11:28,685 --> 00:11:36,669
[SPEAKER_02]: And then they kind of need to shut it down by watching their breath or something.

101
00:11:37,690 --> 00:11:43,032
[SPEAKER_02]: And actually, all that is rooted in just not seeing that that is something that you're doing.

102
00:11:43,072 --> 00:11:44,953
[SPEAKER_02]: Because if I...

