[SPEAKER_03]: It's actually, like, that's the first step.

111
00:12:26,302 --> 00:12:28,844
[SPEAKER_03]: You need to actually recognize, oh, I am actually doing this.

112
00:12:30,085 --> 00:12:38,392
[SPEAKER_02]: And, eh... all of the prerequisites of the graduate training are geared towards making that apparent.

113
00:12:39,253 --> 00:12:49,021
[SPEAKER_02]: Like, eh... you know, having developed yourself in the precepts and sensory strength and all these things, when you're in seclusion, eh... it would become very hard to ignore

114
