[SPEAKER_02]: Obviously for a while, not just like one day or something.

115
00:12:53,720 --> 00:13:02,507
[SPEAKER_02]: But if that becomes your mode of your lifestyle, it would be very hard not to become aware that the daydreaming is actually something that you're doing.

116
